1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,213
She left her family, the familiar
neighborhood, the daily greetings, and her

2
00:00:05,293 --> 00:00:08,780
mother's voice behind as she set out for
university.

3
00:00:29,867 --> 00:00:32,660
At first, everything was new.

4
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:36,319
A new place, new people, a new life...

5
00:00:36,399 --> 00:00:37,571
and new hope.

6
00:00:47,889 --> 00:00:50,408
But life doesn't always turn out the way we
imagine.

7
00:00:57,940 --> 00:01:00,537
Some nights, the silence feels heavy.

8
00:01:00,617 --> 00:01:06,014
She remembers the food at home, her family's
smiles, and the people she loves.

9
00:01:16,527 --> 00:01:20,969
Sometimes she wonders, "Was it right to
leave all this behind?"

10
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:35,290
But each day, she learns a little more: how
to stand on her own, face challenges, and

11
00:01:35,370 --> 00:01:37,246
connect with new people.

12
00:01:48,509 --> 00:01:51,089
Among strangers, she finds friends.

13
00:01:51,169 --> 00:01:54,407
Through hardship, she discovers her
strength.

14
00:01:54,487 --> 00:02:00,378
And the girl who once came from far away
begins to build another home in this new

15
00:02:00,458 --> 00:02:00,821
place.

16
00:02:15,811 --> 00:02:21,611
Because some journeys do more than take us
to another place; they lead us to a new

17
00:02:21,691 --> 00:02:23,096
version of ourselves.

18
00:02:23,176 --> 00:02:25,643
Home is not only where we were born.

19
00:02:25,723 --> 00:02:28,260
It is also where we build our dreams.

